"improv: renaming file in workspace browser selects only file stem initially"
msgstr "改进：在工作区浏览器中重命名文件时，初始只选中文件名主干"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:252
msgid "improv: move document-layout option from canvas-menu to settings"
msgstr "改进：将文档布局选项从画布菜单移到设置中"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:253
