msgstr ""
"PDF 导入对话框，新增与文档页面对齐导入的选项（每个文档页面对应一页 PDF）"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:631
msgid ""
"import bitmap images (e.g. screenshots) from the clipboard (thanks "
"@RickStanley!)"
msgstr "从剪贴板导入位图（例如截图）（感谢 @RickStanley！）"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:632
msgid "proportial shapes / input constraints (thanks @sei0o!)"
msgstr "等比形状/输入约束（感谢 @sei0o！）"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:633
msgid "additional selector modes: single, intersecting path"
msgstr "新增选择工具模式：单选、相交路径"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:634
msgid ""
"improved workspace browser, added sidebar to select between different "
